Evaluation set v2: re-baseline, figure-leg measurement, decision (Follow_Ups RAG-11 and RAG-12; Milestone 2 of plans/2026-09-13-evaluation-set-v2.md), 2026-09-13
Branch evaluation-set-v2 from d6bc2f9 (Milestone 1: rag.evaluation.set, set v2 with 42 questions, 12 new FIGURE questions; plan Amendment 1 applied).
Defaults under test (unchanged since snapshot 51): hybrid-enabled true, rrf-k 60, rrf-vector-weight 1.0, rrf-keyword-weight 0.5, rrf-figure-weight 1.0; rag.evaluation.min-hit-at-5 0.50 before this run.

Harness (one application start per configuration, one POST, stop, port free; the application enable flags never exported; .env holds only POSTGRES_*, SEC_USER_AGENT, OPENAI_API_KEY):
  set -a && source .env && set +a && export INTEGRATION_ACCESS_TOKEN=<32+ chars> SERVER_PORT=8081 <overrides> && nohup ./mvnw -q -o spring-boot:run > worker-app.log 2>&1 &
  wait for "Started StockRecommendationEngineApplication"
  curl -X POST -H "Authorization: Bearer $INTEGRATION_ACCESS_TOKEN" http://localhost:8081/api/rag/evaluate     (no hybrid parameter: properties.hybrid null, hybridEnabled true)
  response properties checked for set, rrfK, and the three weights before stopping
  psql: select row_to_json(r) from retrieval_evaluations r where id=<id>  -> snapshot-<id>-<set>-<configuration>.json
  pkill -f spring-boot:run; pkill -f StockRecommendationEngineApplication; lsof -nP -iTCP:8081 -sTCP:LISTEN (empty: "port 8081 free" after every run)
  RAG_RETRIEVAL_RRF_K and RAG_RETRIEVAL_RRF_VECTOR_WEIGHT never overridden (60 and 1.0 throughout). No chat model; one embedding per question.

